{
  "source": "Prompts/learn-with-ai-2.mp4",
  "duration": 185.9221875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.9,
      "text": "You know the feeling. You have a history quiz tomorrow, an essay due Friday, and a mountain of algebra homework."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.54,
      "end": 11.6,
      "text": "Add in sports, family time, and extracurriculars, and you'd need four extra hours in the day."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.6,
      "end": 17.36,
      "text": "While AI cannot magically extend the clock, it might be your most effective study tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.94,
      "end": 21.46,
      "text": "Used correctly, it helps finish the work while sharpening your understanding."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.5,
      "end": 25.22,
      "text": "In fact, a machine has a clear advantage over a human tutor."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.98,
      "end": 28.12,
      "text": "An AI will quiz you at 1 a.m."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.48,
      "end": 34.42,
      "text": "It will never sigh when you ask the same question twice, and it will patiently try a new explanation whenever you get stuck."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.16,
      "end": 41.62,
      "text": "Treating AI as a patient tutor rather than a shortcut to skip the work is the exact mindset you need to study effectively."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.52,
      "end": 50.96,
      "text": "While you can always open up a standard chat interface to ask questions, some AI tools are built specifically to handle class materials or guide you through difficult concepts."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.66,
      "end": 53.46,
      "text": "This graphic shows two main tools."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.46,
      "end": 60.58,
      "text": "On the left, your primary study tool, Gemini notebook, uses uploaded materials to create focused study aids."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.36,
      "end": 69.72,
      "text": "On the right, your learning coach, like chat GPT study mode or Gemini guided learning, guides you step by step with hints, requiring you to do the thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.62,
      "end": 73.86,
      "text": "Check your class materials. Ask your teacher if something doesn't line up."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.44,
      "end": 76.86,
      "text": "Let's look closer at your study tool, Gemini notebook."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.86,
      "end": 86.26,
      "text": "When you study directly from class materials, this environment keeps the AI grounded in the exact notes, slides, and sources your teacher provided."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.2,
      "end": 88.64,
      "text": "This diagram outlines the workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.4,
      "end": 94.7,
      "text": "On the left, you upload your context, PDFs, slides, websites, or videos."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.44,
      "end": 98.0,
      "text": "On the right, you get custom study aids."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.74,
      "end": 103.16,
      "text": "The tool turns your uploads into targeted quizzes, flashcards, and mind mats."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.84,
      "end": 107.24,
      "text": "Turn your class materials into the study tools you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.0,
      "end": 109.84,
      "text": "Here are four moves for Gemini notebook."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.88,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "One, keep one subject per notebook."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.9,
      "end": 116.96,
      "text": "Two, give it the full picture by uploading all test materials."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.06,
      "end": 119.54,
      "text": "Three, quiz yourself blind."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.36,
      "end": 123.02,
      "text": "Generate a quiz and wait for your answers before grading."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.02,
      "end": 125.16,
      "text": "Four, trace it back."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.02,
      "end": 128.58,
      "text": "Click citations to verify against your original material."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.58,
      "end": 132.1,
      "text": "By separating your subjects, providing complete data,"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.52,
      "end": 138.18,
      "text": "blinding the quiz answers, and tracing your citations, you remove the illusion of competence"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.18,
      "end": 140.94,
      "text": "and force yourself to genuinely grapple with material."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.74,
      "end": 144.16,
      "text": "Sometimes you don't need another study guide."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.72,
      "end": 146.96,
      "text": "You need help understanding something that hasn't clicked."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.86,
      "end": 149.36,
      "text": "This is where a learning coach comes in."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.9,
      "end": 155.06,
      "text": "Chat GPT's Study Mode, or Gemini Guided Learning, walks you through that missing connection"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.06,
      "end": 160.04,
      "text": "by asking questions, providing hints, and offering different explanations when you request them."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.64,
      "end": 163.02,
      "text": "Just tell the AI exactly where you are stuck."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.66,
      "end": 167.96,
      "text": "Attempt to answer its questions, and instead of asking for the final solution,"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.4,
      "end": 170.6,
      "text": "ask for a hint so you can solve it yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.52,
      "end": 172.3,
      "text": "You do the thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.86,
      "end": 174.84,
      "text": "AI helps you figure out your next step."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.66,
      "end": 178.6,
      "text": "Use AI to learn, not to skip the learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.26,
      "end": 179.44,
      "text": "Practice."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.32,
      "end": 180.54,
      "text": "Ask questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.54,
      "end": 182.04,
      "text": "Explain it yourself."
    }
  ],
